{"title":"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2022 AMC 10A #1</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2022 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">2022 AMC 12A #1</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/a/7aa51a6ff483afbbf9a1230d0817384db18841f3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3+\\frac{1}{3+\\frac{1}{3+\\frac13}}?\\]\" width=\"104\" height=\"47\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/6/aa67e6e7f9dcb6cdaf3c9dc17d1147a437e7849e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ \\frac{31}{10}\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\frac{49}{15}\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\frac{33}{10}\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{109}{33}\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ \\frac{15}{4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"426\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We have \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/3/c73cb95f00a723d52e5a01029ad1b686f414e37f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 3+\\frac{1}{3+\\frac{1}{3+\\frac13}} &amp;= 3+\\frac{1}{3+\\frac{1}{\\left(\\frac{10}{3}\\right)}} \\\\ &amp;= 3+\\frac{1}{3+\\frac{3}{10}} \\\\ &amp;= 3+\\frac{1}{\\left(\\frac{33}{10}\\right)} \\\\ &amp;= 3+\\frac{10}{33} \\\\ &amp;= \\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{109}{33}}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"219\" height=\"249\" />\n~MRENTHUSIASM\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Continued fractions with integer parts <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/5/6b50b1e2a036e3897de5cd74a367b0a7da70d160.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"12\" height=\"11\" /> and numerators all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> can be calculated as \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/5/2d50b9330c40e3649f2dc73de9af7b1dade3b1db.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\dfrac{[q_0,q_1,q_2,\\ldots,q_n]}{[q_1,q_2,\\ldots,q_n]} \\end{align*}\" width=\"131\" height=\"43\" />\nwhere\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ff27f1ac44533edff65b124142a523374650446.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} []&amp;=1 \\\\ [q_0,q_1,q_2,\\ldots,q_n]&amp;=q_0[q_1,q_2,\\ldots,q_n]+[q_2,\\ldots,q_n]\\\\ \\end{align*}\" width=\"378\" height=\"43\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/f/d5f90eba04b626636d808ed6f1e41358f3686a87.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} [3]&amp;=3(1) = 3\\\\ [3,3]&amp;=3(3)+1=10\\\\ [3,3,3]&amp;=3(10)+3=33\\\\ [3,3,3,3]&amp;=3(33)+10=109\\\\ \\dfrac{[q_0,q_1,q_2,\\ldots,q_n]}{[q_1,q_2,\\ldots,q_n]}&amp;=\\dfrac{[3,3,3,3]}{[3,3,3]}\\\\ &amp;=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{109}{33}} \\end{align*}\" width=\"289\" height=\"199\" />\n~lopkiloinm\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Finite continued fractions of form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/8/de81d35bf85297eea15caa5c5872c79ecff147dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+\\frac{1}{n+\\frac{1}{n+\\cdots}}=\\frac{x}{y}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"145\" height=\"46\" /> have linear combinations of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/5/32581661cddf01ad30c1e36efe72f99eb0a0adca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x, y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"27\" height=\"11\" /> that solve Pell's Equation. Specifically, the denominator <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and numerator <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> are solutions to the Diophantine equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/a/cda7c314c59617760b63a1156081a5eac7741ab4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n^2+4)\\left(\\frac{y}{2}\\right)^2-\\left(x-\\frac{ny}{2}\\right)^2=\\pm{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"266\" height=\"38\" />. So for this problem in particular, the denominator <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and numerator <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> are solutions to the Diophantine equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/8/1d8f33423fe238b0a6e76739941a4db2eaf693a8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13\\left(\\frac{y}{2}\\right)^2-\\left(x-\\frac{3y}{2}\\right)^2=\\pm{1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"224\" height=\"48\" />. That leaves two answers. Since the number of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />'s in the continued fraction is odd, we further narrow it down to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/e/b3e52847f58b87379f8b6d931e8faaef6eeaa27d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13\\left(\\frac{y}{2}\\right)^2-\\left(x-\\frac{3y}{2}\\right)^2=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"224\" height=\"48\" />, which only leaves us with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> answer and that is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/f/abfba9b040cbf6e0c52fc0890aa9ada58e9432b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x,y)=(109,33)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"136\" height=\"20\" /> which means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/2/a6221955b719c643a9d886c03478fb020cca0470.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}\\ \\frac{109}{33}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"79\" height=\"49\" />. \n</p><p>~lopkiloinm\n</p><p>(Note: Integer solutions increase exponentially, so our next solution will have a numerator greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/3/8a34ad19eec6a21b749aa9165840090553bc4990.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^2(109)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"60\" height=\"21\" />. Therefore, when you don't see numerators greater than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/3/8a34ad19eec6a21b749aa9165840090553bc4990.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^2(109)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"60\" height=\"21\" /> in the answer choices, this method should be fine.)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/iVvBTapX3Fs\">https://youtu.be/iVvBTapX3Fs</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/4zoXEjrBAgk\">https://youtu.be/4zoXEjrBAgk</a>\n</p><p>~Charles3829\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_3\">Video Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7yAh4MtJ8a8&amp;t=222s\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7yAh4MtJ8a8&amp;t=222s</a>\n</p><p>~Math-X\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_4\">Video Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/0b8OGBp1Ew0\">https://youtu.be/0b8OGBp1Ew0</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_5\">Video Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PgJcNkO8Fh8\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PgJcNkO8Fh8</a>\n</p><p>~Math4All999\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=10\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A\">2022 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b>First Problem</b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2022 AMC 10A Problems/Prob